  "notes": "Corrected after GPT-5.5 review: PBO now enumerates all C(S, S/2) splits, not canonical half-splits, because J train / J^c test and J^c train / J test can select different best-in-sample strategies. For S=16 this is 12870 paths. Logit lambda=log(w/(1-w)) where w=rank_oos_of_best_is/(N+1). PBO = mean(lambda<=0). CI 99% via bootstrap dos indicadores (n_boot=1000). Synthetic scenarios after correction: edge constante -> PBO=0, iid noise seed -> PBO=0.447 (near 0.5; noise may land either side), adversarial overfit rotativo -> PBO=1.0. Added regression test to keep complementary splits. Helper build_metric_matrix_from_candidates assumes boolean mask in extra['predicted_mask']; NaN for sub-periods with <2 trades or std=0 must be filtered before cscv_pbo."
